# What is not part of the packaged chart. Argo CD reads this chart out of a git checkout rather
# than out of a package, so nothing here changes what is deployed — but `helm package` and
# `helm lint` both honour it, and a chart that stays packageable is one that can be published
# without first being tidied.
#
# `ci/` is the notable entry: those files exist to prove this chart renders, and shipping the
# arguments to a test alongside the thing tested is how somebody ends up installing one by mistake.
ci/

.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.project
.vscode/
*.swp
*.tmproj
*~
